                                              <object statement-guid="56e47cfe-a5ab-11ef-9b8e-f9190cfb496d" type="literal">     - passed parameters when calling script (-PjiraUser=myUsername -PjiraPass=myPassword) which can be fetched as a secrets on CI/CD or</object>
